# Souvenir stand counter (solid, 1 high): o O l wood with a light o lip
# on top (the walking surface), the front a dark l display with tiny
# wares - snow globe h/w/s on an o/O base, Christmas star Y/o, cowbell
# w/i/m, and below a shelf rail with a Mozartkugel (i/r/R/m), a Hackl
# keychain (i/m/d head, o handle) and a brass bell. Static solid tile:
# no k outline. Left/right ends get an end post (lit o/O left, O/l right).
# Autotiled (D-020): anim `auto`, frame = neighbour mask
# (1 = same tile above, 2 = right, 4 = below, 8 = left; level edge = same).
sprite = tile_standl
size   = 16x16
origin = 0,0
anim   = auto frames=16 ticks=1
